# Allowlist: nothing enters the build context unless listed here.
# docker/service.Dockerfile copies go.work*, libs/ and services/<SERVICE>/.
*

!go.work
!go.work.sum
!libs
!services
# Contracts source: not compiled into any binary today (libs/contracts holds
# the generated Go); allowed so a service can go:embed a spec without a
# .dockerignore change.
!api

# …and, inside those, never:
**/node_modules
**/bin
**/testdata
**/*_test.go
**/coverage*.out
**/*.test
**/.gremlins.yaml
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
